            "Epoch 6/200 | Cost: 942.6416 | Train acc: 67.88% | Test acc: -2234549.50%\n",
            "Epoch 7/200 | Cost: 820.1109 | Train acc: 72.06% | Test acc: -2334445.71%\n",
